    "  { \"kana\": \"text\" }  — the learner types this kana/katakana (romaji→kana), 1 point",
    "  { \"kanji\": \"字\", \"read\": \"かんじ\" } — a freehand drawing box for this kanji run, 1 point;",
    "                                  'read' gives the reading shown under the box and in furigana",
    "  { \"fixed\": \"text\" } — shown as-is, not scored (particles / pre-written aids).",
    "Word-part points: one per scored cell. Bunpou items are worth 3 marks in the real test,",
    "so each shows x / 3 where x = 3 × (cells correct ÷ cells scored), rounded.",
    "If a unit has no entry (or parts is empty), the mock falls back to auto-generated",
    "kana rows from the unit's own vocabulary pool."
